# Netlify redirects — short, UTM-tagged links for off-site placements.
#
# Why these exist: every link posted on Instagram currently lands in GA4 as one
# undifferentiated "ig / social" bucket, so there's no way to tell whether the
# bio link, a story sticker or a post link is doing the work. These short paths
# carry the UTM tags for you, so the link you paste stays clean and you can
# change where any of them points without editing your Instagram bio again.
#
# 302 (temporary) is deliberate — it keeps browsers from caching the
# destination, so re-pointing a link takes effect immediately.
#
# NOTE: do not use /ig — there is an ig/ image directory at the repo root.

# --- Instagram -------------------------------------------------------------
# Bio link. Points at /edit (the capture page), not the homepage: the whole
# point of the bio link is to convert reach into an email address.
/bio      /edit/?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=bio&utm_campaign=profile        302
/story    /edit/?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=story&utm_campaign=stories      302
/post     /edit/?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=post&utm_campaign=feed          302

# Per-campaign links. Add one per post you want measured separately — the
# campaign name is what shows up in GA4, so make it readable.
#
# Two per edition, because the same edition gets posted to the feed AND to
# stories, and those convert very differently. Same destination, different
# utm_medium, so GA4 can tell them apart. Use the plain one in a caption or
# the bio, the -story one in a link sticker.
/re             /edit/wellness-real-estate/?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=post&utm_campaign=wellness-real-estate   302
/re-story       /edit/wellness-real-estate/?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=story&utm_campaign=wellness-real-estate  302
/girona         /edit/off-grid-girona/?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=post&utm_campaign=off-grid-girona             302
/girona-story   /edit/off-grid-girona/?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=story&utm_campaign=off-grid-girona            302
/lisbon         /edit/lisbon/?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=post&utm_campaign=lisbon                               302
/lisbon-story   /edit/lisbon/?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=story&utm_campaign=lisbon                              302
/solo           /edit/capital-buys-protocols/?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=post&utm_campaign=solo-travellers       302
/solo-story     /edit/capital-buys-protocols/?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=story&utm_campaign=solo-travellers      302

